<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani cotton yarn rates close steady.</title>
<headline>Pakistani cotton yarn rates close steady.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton yarn rates closed steady on Sunday in the absence of large export orders because of the year-end holiday season and likely to remain stable in the next few days, dealers said.</p>
<p>Following are the rates in rupees supplied by the Pakistan Yarn Merchants Association for 10-lb (4.54 kg) cone of 21 counts:</p>
<p>				   Sunday	Dec 18</p>
<p>    Al-Karam		     510	   510</p>
<p>    Taj Textile		  510	   510</p>
<p>    Suraiya Textile	    500	   500</p>
<p>($1=40.22 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
